106:handle has multiple observable realization stages. Every anonymous J.signature
107-or C handle materially used by address, transfer, synchronization, placement,
108:or sharing realization must anchor an instance; dependencies then route only
109:between the declared i* instance IDs.
110:Every source program-coordinate occurrence must remain a distinct
111:domain-anchored realization path entering an address_base instance, even when
112:the current concrete grid extent on that axis is one. One logical domain may
113:therefore have both a program-coordinate path into address_base and a separate
