115-or erase it as constant-degenerate topology.
116:Preserve source event multiplicity, def-use routes, partial order, regions, and
117:one-producer sharing exactly; do not use duplicate instances as an undocumented
118-code. Logical operators, predicates, fills, constants, index formulas, shapes,
119:and effects remain exclusively in J.
120-
121-The source is already alpha-renamed. Do not invent or recover original names.
